I just finished my best game of 4.3 PL7 yet.  My first encounter with Medusa,
however.....

In this game, I had obtained intrinsic telepathy in the usual fashion.  I also
had an amulet of esp I was wearing before I gained the intrinsic, which I
dropped at that time.  Later, I discovered I had *lost* telepathy!!  This
occurred on of those bones-shop levels, while I was in the shop, I think.  This
couldn't be some subtle result of the onbill bug, could it?  I've never heard of
any discussion about losing intrinsics (except for the "intrinsics" resulting
from having/wearing certain items or temporary clairvoyance when granted
by a god), and I never lost telepathy in my hundreds of games.
In fact, I lost it twice this game, the second time after I'd senselessly
murdered two priests and all the shopkeepers.  Second theory:  Crom was
miffed?  Sure, I got the lightning storm in the temples, but did MY god
punish me for my kill-fest?

